                                        "value": {
                                            "code": null,
                                            "comment": "",
                                            "message": "<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; padding-left: 16px;\">\n<li>In the previous sub-prod instance, go to the Update Sets module, ensure the update set is in a \"Completed\" state, and use \"Export to XML\" to download it as an XML file.</li>\n<li>In the current sub-prod instance, navigate to System Update Sets &gt; Update Sources and use \"Import Update Set from XML\" to upload the file, making it appear in the list of imported update sets.</li>\n</ul>"
                                        }
                                    }
